    '@type': 'BlogPosting',
    headline: 'IT to non-IT career switch India: 6 real doors, and what each one actually costs you',
    description:
      'IT to non-IT career switch India: teaching, government exams, HR and L&D, consulting, entrepreneurship, and non-IT finance compared on real entry routes, pay resets, and timelines.',
    datePublished: publishedDateISO,
    dateModified: publishedDateISO,
    mainEntityOfPage: canonical,
    inLanguage: 'en-IN',
    author: {
      '@type': 'Person',
